6. Your data is your responsibility
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The instances, saves, mods and account credentials the launcher manages all live on
your own computer. We cannot reach them and cannot recover them. Backups are up to
you. For the details of what goes where, see PRIVACY.md.

