7. Third-party content
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The launcher fetches content from Modrinth, CurseForge, the official loader sources,
mirror nodes and similar, and displays server information contributed by the
community. That content is the responsibility of whoever provides it. This project
makes no guarantee about its availability, accuracy, safety or legality, and
displaying something does not imply endorsement of it. When you obtain third-party
content through the launcher, that third party's own terms apply to you as well.

Minecraft and its related names, trademarks and assets belong to Mojang Studios and
Microsoft.

